  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For me and many people, the back button at the top of the action menu is both taking space and making things feel inconsistent. Puppet and radial menus use the trigger to go back, we should have an option to remove the back button and always use the trigger. It feels better and gives users more space in their menus, if they would choose to enable it. Something like \"trigger to cancel\" in the action menu options.",
